    <div class="info">
        <h3>Next Steps:</h3>
        <ol>
            <li>Start Headscale: <code>docker compose up -d</code></li>
            <li>Create a user: <code>docker exec headfwd-headscale headscale users create default</code></li>
            <li>Generate pre-auth key: <code>docker exec headfwd-headscale headscale preauthkeys create --user default</code></li>
            <li>Connect devices to the mesh network</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
    
    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; color: #666;">
        <small>HeadFwd • Self-Owned P2P Remote Access</small>
